        "nobel_worthiness": "HPV virus-like particle vaccines provide exceptionally clear prevention of infection and cancers, combining conceptual insight with global medical consequence.",
        "attribution": "Frazer, Lowy, and Schiller are a coherent three-person attribution for the central VLP vaccine advance.",
        "maturity": "Large-scale use and long follow-up have firmly established prevention of HPV infection and precancerous disease.",
