        "nobel_worthiness": "TNF blockade transformed rheumatoid arthritis care and established a broadly influential therapeutic strategy for inflammatory disease.",
        "attribution": "Feldmann and Maini form a notably direct pairing between the pathogenic hypothesis and clinical demonstration.",
        "maturity": "The benefit, limitations, and mechanistic importance of TNF inhibition have been confirmed through prolonged clinical practice.",
