        "nobel_worthiness": "Chaperonin-assisted protein folding established a fundamental mechanism by which cells achieve productive protein folding.",
        "attribution": "Hartl and Horwich are closely and clearly associated with the decisive experimental and conceptual advances.",
        "maturity": "The result is a longstanding core principle of molecular cell biology with broad biomedical relevance.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The field includes earlier and parallel contributions to the broader protein-folding framework."
        ]
      }
    },
