        "attribution": "Krainer and Bennett provide a compact attribution spanning the splicing mechanism and therapeutic antisense platform.",
        "maturity": "Clinical benefit of SMN-targeted antisense therapy is established, while its long-term effects are increasingly well characterized.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Clinical translation also relied on substantial contributions from additional academic, clinical, and industrial investigators.",
