        "maturity": "The intervention has decades of clinical use, defined indications, and extensive evidence of symptomatic benefit.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The discovery was enabled by broader prior work in functional neurosurgery and Parkinson's disease.",
          "It is principally symptomatic rather than disease-modifying."
